// `gen` is listed, and its folder is not there, as on a fresh clone of a project whose module a generator writes. The
// note says what is missing: through 0.9.860 it said the manifest listed no such module, sending the reader to edit
// a manifest that was already right. (A folder nobody listed: xfail/module_unlisted_folder.)
import { game::gen::World };
fn uint8 main() { World w = World.of(n: 2); return cast<uint8>(w.n); }
